 its way to influence]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/127881139.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[China is employing a 'salami slicing' strategy, taking incremental steps across military, economic, and technological domains to alter realities without triggering conflict. This 'gray zone' approach, evident in the South China Sea and beyond, bypasses international law and exploits rivals' hesitation. The cumulative effect creates new facts on the ground, challenging the existing order.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/china/inside-chinas-gray-zone-activities-how-beijing-is-salami-slicing-its-way-to-influence/articleshow/127881139.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/china/inside-chinas-gray-zone-activities-how-beijing-is-salami-slicing-its-way-to-influence/articleshow/127881139.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-02-03T15:39:48+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Yash Sonkar</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-127882784,imgsize-1482852.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Twitch CEO Dan Clancy debuts "Let's Chat" podcast live with Cam Skattebo tomorrow]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/127894503.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Twitch CEO Dan Clancy is launching the platform's first podcast, "Let's Chat," with NFL star Cam Skattebo as the inaugural guest. The live show, airing tomorrow, February 4, 2026, will explore how live streaming shapes online culture and creator stories.  This initiative aims to foster deeper connections within the Twitch community, featuring bi-monthly live recordings with top streamers.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us-streamers/twitch-ceo-dan-clancy-debuts-lets-chat-podcast-live-with-cam-skattebo-tomorrow/articleshow/127894503.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us-streamers/twitch-ceo-dan-clancy-debuts-lets-chat-podcast-live-with-cam-skattebo-tomorrow/articleshow/127894503.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-02-04T02:59:42+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Sumit Roy</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-127894504,imgsize-565127.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Clavicular and Jenny Popach clash on live stream as girlfriend Violet’s anger sparks shocking viral controversy]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/127897081.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[A viral Kick stream showed Clavicular’s girlfriend Violet fighting with TikTok star Jenny Popach after a heated argument. The issue began when Violet believed Jenny was flirting with Clavicular on camera. The moment spread fast on X. Clavicular later said he did not understand how the fight even started.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us-streamers/clavicular-and-jenny-popach-clash-on-live-stream-as-girlfriend-violets-anger-sparks-shocking-viral-controversy/articleshow/127897081.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us-streamers/clavicular-and-jenny-popach-clash-on-live-stream-as-girlfriend-violets-anger-sparks-shocking-viral-controversy/articleshow/127897081.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-02-04T04:51:53+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Sehjal Gupta</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-127897077,imgsize-677766.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Indian-origin restaurant owner caught spiking woman’s drink at UK club; staff swap glass before calling police]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="1